<title>UK: RALLYING-RAC FIRST DAY POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-RAC FIRST DAY POSITIONS.</headline>
<text>
<p>CHESTER, England, Nov 23 (Retuer) - Leading first day</p>
<p>positions after nine stages of the RAC Rally on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Armin Schwarz (Germany) Toyota  2 hours 19 minutes and 51</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p> 2. Masao Kamioka (Japan) Subaru	   4 minutes 32 seconds</p>
<p>behind</p>
<p> 3. Stig Blomqvist (Sweden) Skoda	 10:36</p>
<p> 4. Krzysztof Holowczyc (Poland) Ford   12:35</p>
<p> 5. Gwyndaf Evans (Britain) Ford	  13:42</p>
<p> 6. Pavel Sibera (Czech Republic)	 13:58</p>
</text>
